xyce bipolar transistors: the Q lines of X-M4
* 3 to 5 nodes, a bracketed or plain substrate, the area, OFF, IC= and the closed list
VC c 0 5
VB b 0 0.7
VS s 0 -1
RS [s] 0 1k
Q1 c b 0 qn
Q2 c b 0 s qn 2
Q3 c b 0 [s] qn area=2 off
q4 C
+ B 0
+ QN ic=0.7, 5 m=2 temp=50 ; a comment
Q5 c b 0 0 qp OFF=1 ic1=0.6 ic2=4
Q6 c b 0 qn {2} temp=27
X1 c b thermal
.SUBCKT thermal cc bb
VT dt 0 0
Q7 cc bb 0 dt qv sw_et=1
Q8 cc bb 0 0 dt qv12
Q9 cc bb 0 0 dt qh dt=0
.MODEL qv npn level=11
.MODEL qv12 npn level=12
.MODEL qh npn level=230
.ENDS
.MODEL qn npn bf=100
.MODEL qp pnp
.END
